{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RATING STARS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Renders a 0-5 rating (halves supported) as TrustPilot-style stars: solid green stars, one half-filled star for a .5
remainder, and light gray outline stars for the rest. Shared by the rating badge on the product page and by the
customer reviews section, so both always match.

Layout styles for ".rating-star" live in assets/custom.css, since a snippet rendered several times per page can't
carry its own <style> without duplicating it.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* rating: the rating out of 5 (required, e.g. 4.5)
* uid: a string unique on the page, used for the half star's mask id (required when a half star may be drawn)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign full_stars = rating | floor
  assign remainder = rating | minus: full_stars
  assign has_half_star = false

  if remainder >= 0.5
    assign has_half_star = true
  endif

  assign empty_stars = 5 | minus: full_stars

  if has_half_star
    assign empty_stars = empty_stars | minus: 1
  endif

  if empty_stars < 0
    assign empty_stars = 0
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Exact star markup as supplied by the design — do not resize or redraw these. The full star is a 19x20 asset; the
  half and empty stars are 19x19. That size difference is intentional, not a bug. No separate "empty" asset was
  supplied, so the not-yet-earned stars reuse the half star's own outline path in gray.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if full_stars > 0 -%}
  {%- for i in (1..full_stars) -%}
    <span class="rating-star">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="20" viewBox="0 0 19 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M4.61138 17.5001L5.89783 11.6459L1.58325 7.70842L7.28325 7.18758L9.49992 1.66675L11.7166 7.18758L17.4166 7.70842L13.102 11.6459L14.3885 17.5001L9.49992 14.3959L4.61138 17.5001Z" fill="#00B67A"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if has_half_star -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    The half star masks the star shape so its left half fills solid green while an outline traces the whole shape.
    The mask id has to be unique on the page, hence the uid.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="rating-star">
    <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <mask id="half-star-{{ uid }}" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="1" y="1" width="17" height="16">
        <path d="M4.50828 16.2535L5.76598 10.8164L1.54785 7.15937L7.12042 6.67564L9.28754 1.5481L11.4546 6.67564L17.0272 7.15937L12.8091 10.8164L14.0668 16.2535L9.28754 13.3705L4.50828 16.2535Z" fill="#00B67A"/>
      </mask>
      <g mask="url(#half-star-{{ uid }})">
        <rect y="1.5481" width="9.28762" height="14.7054" fill="#00B67A"/>
      </g>
      <path d="M10.9941 6.87036L11.1113 7.14771L11.4111 7.17407L15.8066 7.55493L12.4814 10.4387L12.2539 10.636L12.3223 10.929L13.3135 15.2151L9.5459 12.9426L9.28711 12.7864L9.0293 12.9426L5.26074 15.2151L6.25293 10.929L6.32129 10.636L6.09375 10.4387L2.76758 7.55493L7.16406 7.17407L7.46387 7.14771L7.58105 6.87036L9.28711 2.8313L10.9941 6.87036Z" stroke="#00B67A"/>
    </svg>
  </span>
{%- endif -%}

{%- if empty_stars > 0 -%}
  {%- for i in (1..empty_stars) -%}
    <span class="rating-star">
      <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 19 19" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M10.9941 6.87036L11.1113 7.14771L11.4111 7.17407L15.8066 7.55493L12.4814 10.4387L12.2539 10.636L12.3223 10.929L13.3135 15.2151L9.5459 12.9426L9.28711 12.7864L9.0293 12.9426L5.26074 15.2151L6.25293 10.929L6.32129 10.636L6.09375 10.4387L2.76758 7.55493L7.16406 7.17407L7.46387 7.14771L7.58105 6.87036L9.28711 2.8313L10.9941 6.87036Z" stroke="#d8d8d8"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
